[[:db/retract 17592186063198 :answer-field/choices 17592186063200] [:db/retract 17592186063198 :answer-field/choices 17592186063201] [:db/retract 17592186063198 :answer-field/choices 17592186063202] [:db/retract 17592186063198 :answer-field/choices 17592186063203] [:db/retract 17592186063198 :answer-field/choices 17592186063199] {:db/id 17592186064225 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-d54d59da-aeb4-5592-b790-f9a9feee5b10" "question-0c4f53f7-a91f-5a87-b60c-2cd20463d6e9" "question-cdc94a5e-ffa3-5e3c-b067-8b7e71e5c799"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064226 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1a4cd24e-1cbf-547b-aab3-c78dc742ec94" "question-77e54e57-de69-5688-a9c9-dfe71c2ce5e6" "question-8cd683e0-e43d-570b-a907-b426c76c1c6f" "question-49b73c78-3335-57b5-a631-c7f8dd771090"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064227 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-a60367e9-cec6-56ff-bdf1-1a7368d63d95" "question-dadcc805-1744-58ea-b449-313016666d23" "question-c26cdc41-d401-5858-96e0-ffa4a20294ca" "question-f01d9ac9-bb7d-5b0c-be19-2dc05bc65cd7"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-d54d59da-aeb4-5592-b790-f9a9feee5b10" :question/id #uuid "d54d59da-aeb4-5592-b790-f9a9feee5b10" :question/math-academy-id "q-358220" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}\\frac{9}{{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we use the identity $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡3x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}\\frac{9}{{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}9{(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)})}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}9{sec}^{2}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =9{\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}{sec}^{2}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=3x.$ Then $\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.$ \n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=3x.$\n\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{12}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{9}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ |\n\nTherefore, the integral in terms of the new variable is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}9{\\int }_{\\pi /12}^{\\pi /9}{sec}^{2}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =9{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}{sec}^{2}⁡u\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}{sec}^{2}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{tan}⁡u{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =3(\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =3(\\sqrt{3}-1) \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{3}-3.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0a251513-9691-50f6-b973-f2685262f1ed"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0a251513-9691-50f6-b973-f2685262f1ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a251513-9691-50f6-b973-f2685262f1ed" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-86a74f3d-6597-59e4-b81c-8406532b8b29" :answer-field/choices ["answer-86a74f3d-6597-59e4-b81c-8406532b8b29"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-86a74f3d-6597-59e4-b81c-8406532b8b29" :answer/id #uuid "86a74f3d-6597-59e4-b81c-8406532b8b29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{3}-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064857 :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cot}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply out the parentheses and then use the identity ${cot}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cot}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x+\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}+\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int ({csc}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186063198 :answer-field/correct "answer-f002d208-93d4-565e-847d-55497116f0c2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f002d208-93d4-565e-847d-55497116f0c2" "answer-cb6108cc-2a4c-50ea-9d2d-80ef3ef54486" "answer-8eef9722-f326-5995-94aa-696c6de0feb2" "answer-c9711a7d-8c7c-54ef-b29c-11352c7fb2db" "answer-ab45b025-5861-5024-8958-4ef3403a84cd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f002d208-93d4-565e-847d-55497116f0c2" :answer/id #uuid "f002d208-93d4-565e-847d-55497116f0c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb6108cc-2a4c-50ea-9d2d-80ef3ef54486" :answer/id #uuid "cb6108cc-2a4c-50ea-9d2d-80ef3ef54486" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8eef9722-f326-5995-94aa-696c6de0feb2" :answer/id #uuid "8eef9722-f326-5995-94aa-696c6de0feb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9711a7d-8c7c-54ef-b29c-11352c7fb2db" :answer/id #uuid "c9711a7d-8c7c-54ef-b29c-11352c7fb2db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ab45b025-5861-5024-8958-4ef3403a84cd" :answer/id #uuid "ab45b025-5861-5024-8958-4ef3403a84cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0c4f53f7-a91f-5a87-b60c-2cd20463d6e9" :question/id #uuid "0c4f53f7-a91f-5a87-b60c-2cd20463d6e9" :question/math-academy-id "q-114301" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{cot}⁡x(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply out the parentheses and then use the identity $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cot}⁡x(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\cdot 3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\cdot 2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot 3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\cdot 2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ec74a8fe-dc16-5d8a-9024-ad8266707d7b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ec74a8fe-dc16-5d8a-9024-ad8266707d7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec74a8fe-dc16-5d8a-9024-ad8266707d7b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-509e529a-c315-525e-8dd6-81ff51ba0502" :answer-field/choices ["answer-250b85cf-f9d6-591c-929e-2bd040932967" "answer-63d630c2-d867-5897-a83c-5179a2334d2a" "answer-d2651229-f5ff-524e-ae48-22a82959fa2a" "answer-509e529a-c315-525e-8dd6-81ff51ba0502" "answer-f748e060-6e5e-5da9-b6ea-84a0653e22cb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-250b85cf-f9d6-591c-929e-2bd040932967" :answer/id #uuid "250b85cf-f9d6-591c-929e-2bd040932967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-63d630c2-d867-5897-a83c-5179a2334d2a" :answer/id #uuid "63d630c2-d867-5897-a83c-5179a2334d2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d2651229-f5ff-524e-ae48-22a82959fa2a" :answer/id #uuid "d2651229-f5ff-524e-ae48-22a82959fa2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-509e529a-c315-525e-8dd6-81ff51ba0502" :answer/id #uuid "509e529a-c315-525e-8dd6-81ff51ba0502" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f748e060-6e5e-5da9-b6ea-84a0653e22cb" :answer/id #uuid "f748e060-6e5e-5da9-b6ea-84a0653e22cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cdc94a5e-ffa3-5e3c-b067-8b7e71e5c799" :question/id #uuid "cdc94a5e-ffa3-5e3c-b067-8b7e71e5c799" :question/math-academy-id "q-358219" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}3\\operatorname{sec}⁡2x{cos}^{2}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the identity $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}3\\operatorname{sec}⁡2x{cos}^{2}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=2x.$ Then $\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.$ \n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=2x.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ |\n\nTherefore, the integral in terms of the new variable is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}(sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-sin\\,(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d8cb6fe3-1966-59eb-9541-67fe64eb26b5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d8cb6fe3-1966-59eb-9541-67fe64eb26b5" :answer-field/id #uuid "d8cb6fe3-1966-59eb-9541-67fe64eb26b5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-4783ae01-0409-5f42-a49a-a5011eafe80c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4783ae01-0409-5f42-a49a-a5011eafe80c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4783ae01-0409-5f42-a49a-a5011eafe80c" :answer/id #uuid "4783ae01-0409-5f42-a49a-a5011eafe80c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1a4cd24e-1cbf-547b-aab3-c78dc742ec94" :question/id #uuid "1a4cd24e-1cbf-547b-aab3-c78dc742ec94" :question/math-academy-id "q-114308" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}({tan}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that ${tan}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}$ to express this as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}(\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}-{sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{3}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}(\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}-{sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}-\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int ({sec}^{2}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-aca77544-0046-5524-9cef-1c8e548a94a1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-aca77544-0046-5524-9cef-1c8e548a94a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "aca77544-0046-5524-9cef-1c8e548a94a1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c6086863-df11-58f0-9fa7-5134443d4b1d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bb236701-7224-5bb8-9211-7b2730f8e9b3" "answer-854da0b1-b538-5abb-9128-538e7a7c49e3" "answer-1ce83bb5-48a8-5755-a136-3a2157d2ef78" "answer-ee6b0533-0ce9-53e9-9ea2-abb22d26246a" "answer-c6086863-df11-58f0-9fa7-5134443d4b1d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bb236701-7224-5bb8-9211-7b2730f8e9b3" :answer/id #uuid "bb236701-7224-5bb8-9211-7b2730f8e9b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-854da0b1-b538-5abb-9128-538e7a7c49e3" :answer/id #uuid "854da0b1-b538-5abb-9128-538e7a7c49e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ce83bb5-48a8-5755-a136-3a2157d2ef78" :answer/id #uuid "1ce83bb5-48a8-5755-a136-3a2157d2ef78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee6b0533-0ce9-53e9-9ea2-abb22d26246a" :answer/id #uuid "ee6b0533-0ce9-53e9-9ea2-abb22d26246a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c6086863-df11-58f0-9fa7-5134443d4b1d" :answer/id #uuid "c6086863-df11-58f0-9fa7-5134443d4b1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-77e54e57-de69-5688-a9c9-dfe71c2ce5e6" :question/id #uuid "77e54e57-de69-5688-a9c9-dfe71c2ce5e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-352711" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the identities $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x$ and $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡x{|}_{0}^{\\pi /6} \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5fe9e96d-c290-5de0-aea5-06fc2a18c7e7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5fe9e96d-c290-5de0-aea5-06fc2a18c7e7" :answer-field/id #uuid "5fe9e96d-c290-5de0-aea5-06fc2a18c7e7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-e1161462-0f9d-545a-a5a5-27e6a35427ab" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e1161462-0f9d-545a-a5a5-27e6a35427ab"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1161462-0f9d-545a-a5a5-27e6a35427ab" :answer/id #uuid "e1161462-0f9d-545a-a5a5-27e6a35427ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-8cd683e0-e43d-570b-a907-b426c76c1c6f" :question/id #uuid "8cd683e0-e43d-570b-a907-b426c76c1c6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-114319" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ and $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ to express this as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0] \\\\  & =-[\\frac{1}{2}-1] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-07a0cda5-2de4-5cc2-802a-a5549d6da26a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-07a0cda5-2de4-5cc2-802a-a5549d6da26a" :answer-field/id #uuid "07a0cda5-2de4-5cc2-802a-a5549d6da26a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ffc2a33e-12cb-5317-9535-02af0caa9a61" :answer-field/choices ["answer-02b90dc2-4752-56a7-9b8f-d500c9d40dff" "answer-1fc5523c-58ee-55e0-80dd-791ed4446cb6" "answer-ffc2a33e-12cb-5317-9535-02af0caa9a61" "answer-a842be8e-7dd8-5330-8aa6-c7e1963f7629" "answer-c1c701b6-77f3-5b86-8e8d-cbfebc97a0af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-02b90dc2-4752-56a7-9b8f-d500c9d40dff" :answer/id #uuid "02b90dc2-4752-56a7-9b8f-d500c9d40dff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1fc5523c-58ee-55e0-80dd-791ed4446cb6" :answer/id #uuid "1fc5523c-58ee-55e0-80dd-791ed4446cb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffc2a33e-12cb-5317-9535-02af0caa9a61" :answer/id #uuid "ffc2a33e-12cb-5317-9535-02af0caa9a61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a842be8e-7dd8-5330-8aa6-c7e1963f7629" :answer/id #uuid "a842be8e-7dd8-5330-8aa6-c7e1963f7629" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c1c701b6-77f3-5b86-8e8d-cbfebc97a0af" :answer/id #uuid "c1c701b6-77f3-5b86-8e8d-cbfebc97a0af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-49b73c78-3335-57b5-a631-c7f8dd771090" :question/id #uuid "49b73c78-3335-57b5-a631-c7f8dd771090" :question/math-academy-id "q-73365" :question/problem "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1-{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1-{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}(1-{tan}^{2}⁡x)\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nThen, we use the fact that $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}(1-{tan}^{2}⁡x)\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}(1-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x})\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}(\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x})\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we use the fact that $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x$ to express this as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\frac{1-{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x{|}_{0}^{\\pi /6} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{tan}⁡0 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e803221b-b806-5450-a5a1-2379c91d357f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e803221b-b806-5450-a5a1-2379c91d357f" :answer-field/id #uuid "e803221b-b806-5450-a5a1-2379c91d357f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6590c99b-1fe0-54a5-9f86-8aebcedc658b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6d4d7986-64b5-5587-b804-bab2a0930585" "answer-2ade44e9-b6f9-500e-bc09-791aec3c4112" "answer-ae2dad62-d368-5197-b93b-e3e45fe17653" "answer-fd953cc5-abf5-5b0c-84f3-3e4672a326d3" "answer-6590c99b-1fe0-54a5-9f86-8aebcedc658b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d4d7986-64b5-5587-b804-bab2a0930585" :answer/id #uuid "6d4d7986-64b5-5587-b804-bab2a0930585" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2ade44e9-b6f9-500e-bc09-791aec3c4112" :answer/id #uuid "2ade44e9-b6f9-500e-bc09-791aec3c4112" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae2dad62-d368-5197-b93b-e3e45fe17653" :answer/id #uuid "ae2dad62-d368-5197-b93b-e3e45fe17653" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fd953cc5-abf5-5b0c-84f3-3e4672a326d3" :answer/id #uuid "fd953cc5-abf5-5b0c-84f3-3e4672a326d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6590c99b-1fe0-54a5-9f86-8aebcedc658b" :answer/id #uuid "6590c99b-1fe0-54a5-9f86-8aebcedc658b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a60367e9-cec6-56ff-bdf1-1a7368d63d95" :question/id #uuid "a60367e9-cec6-56ff-bdf1-1a7368d63d95" :question/math-academy-id "q-10040" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We use the identity $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ and rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$ Then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\nHence\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-{\\int }_{1}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)}\\frac{1}{u}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|{|}_{1}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)|+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1| \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-92469112-1ed0-55aa-bae5-7ad7d5ef9904"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-92469112-1ed0-55aa-bae5-7ad7d5ef9904" :answer-field/id #uuid "92469112-1ed0-55aa-bae5-7ad7d5ef9904" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9bf286e8-c095-5023-811d-f2ea8779fe1a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9bf286e8-c095-5023-811d-f2ea8779fe1a" "answer-8054347c-d721-5221-af8e-16ee957f8128" "answer-64b06414-fa24-5496-803e-0ac49b1edb16" "answer-2015152c-6dd4-56e6-906d-eca5aee8113b" "answer-b4e9383f-e46d-5cc2-b821-2e62b2d63f2b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9bf286e8-c095-5023-811d-f2ea8779fe1a" :answer/id #uuid "9bf286e8-c095-5023-811d-f2ea8779fe1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8054347c-d721-5221-af8e-16ee957f8128" :answer/id #uuid "8054347c-d721-5221-af8e-16ee957f8128" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-64b06414-fa24-5496-803e-0ac49b1edb16" :answer/id #uuid "64b06414-fa24-5496-803e-0ac49b1edb16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2015152c-6dd4-56e6-906d-eca5aee8113b" :answer/id #uuid "2015152c-6dd4-56e6-906d-eca5aee8113b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4e9383f-e46d-5cc2-b821-2e62b2d63f2b" :answer/id #uuid "b4e9383f-e46d-5cc2-b821-2e62b2d63f2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-dadcc805-1744-58ea-b449-313016666d23" :question/id #uuid "dadcc805-1744-58ea-b449-313016666d23" :question/math-academy-id "q-362158" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /24}^{\\pi /8}\\operatorname{cot}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x.$ Then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x.$\n\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{24}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{8}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $1$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /24}^{\\pi /8}\\operatorname{cot}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /24}^{\\pi /8}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|{|}_{1/2}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4c69fd7b-4aa9-5d3d-a2cf-a03772cdb2a1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4c69fd7b-4aa9-5d3d-a2cf-a03772cdb2a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c69fd7b-4aa9-5d3d-a2cf-a03772cdb2a1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-4afbb947-1a46-57c3-a2dc-395ab6315772" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4afbb947-1a46-57c3-a2dc-395ab6315772"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4afbb947-1a46-57c3-a2dc-395ab6315772" :answer/id #uuid "4afbb947-1a46-57c3-a2dc-395ab6315772" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-c26cdc41-d401-5858-96e0-ffa4a20294ca" :question/id #uuid "c26cdc41-d401-5858-96e0-ffa4a20294ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-49279" :question/problem "${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We use the identity $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x$ and rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}{tan}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$ Then,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,du={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$\n\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |\n\nTherefore, the integral in terms of the new variable is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}{tan}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\sqrt{3}/3}^{\\sqrt{3}}{u}^{2}\\,\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}{|}_{\\sqrt{3}/3}^{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}({(\\sqrt{3})}^{3}-{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(3\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}(3-\\frac{1}{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{26\\sqrt{3}}{27}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-82084fd2-bb79-5568-8b5b-a9fbb9530769"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-82084fd2-bb79-5568-8b5b-a9fbb9530769" :answer-field/id #uuid "82084fd2-bb79-5568-8b5b-a9fbb9530769" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-14b36ff5-eeb9-52d4-b7b8-21c79368f8b6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-85271a33-9aae-5b9d-a3b8-a96dd470bdac" "answer-14b36ff5-eeb9-52d4-b7b8-21c79368f8b6" "answer-05f4f35f-6fb8-5362-bb51-1c0b0c319dc2" "answer-dcaf3e71-8a60-5d8e-be80-97ff5b0a7a92" "answer-41aaf43b-2c95-50cf-a8a3-79ae4c22104b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-85271a33-9aae-5b9d-a3b8-a96dd470bdac" :answer/id #uuid "85271a33-9aae-5b9d-a3b8-a96dd470bdac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{14\\sqrt{3}}{27}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14b36ff5-eeb9-52d4-b7b8-21c79368f8b6" :answer/id #uuid "14b36ff5-eeb9-52d4-b7b8-21c79368f8b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{26\\sqrt{3}}{27}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-05f4f35f-6fb8-5362-bb51-1c0b0c319dc2" :answer/id #uuid "05f4f35f-6fb8-5362-bb51-1c0b0c319dc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcaf3e71-8a60-5d8e-be80-97ff5b0a7a92" :answer/id #uuid "dcaf3e71-8a60-5d8e-be80-97ff5b0a7a92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-41aaf43b-2c95-50cf-a8a3-79ae4c22104b" :answer/id #uuid "41aaf43b-2c95-50cf-a8a3-79ae4c22104b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9\\sqrt{3}}{20}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186320413 :answer-field/correct "answer-da2d4300-1fc2-5499-8622-53086d327657" :answer-field/choices ["answer-da2d4300-1fc2-5499-8622-53086d327657"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da2d4300-1fc2-5499-8622-53086d327657" :answer/id #uuid "da2d4300-1fc2-5499-8622-53086d327657" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{3}{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f01d9ac9-bb7d-5b0c-be19-2dc05bc65cd7" :question/id #uuid "f01d9ac9-bb7d-5b0c-be19-2dc05bc65cd7" :question/math-academy-id "q-114295" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "We use the identity $\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}$ and rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}).$ Then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,⟹\\,-2\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})}\\,\\text{d}x & =-2\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e27fa184-c2a1-506b-ac6d-5109a0a21c79"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e27fa184-c2a1-506b-ac6d-5109a0a21c79" :answer-field/id #uuid "e27fa184-c2a1-506b-ac6d-5109a0a21c79" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1fc34fbe-0ac6-5122-9d50-7ed8124d6804" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1fc34fbe-0ac6-5122-9d50-7ed8124d6804" "answer-4e22d3f7-480b-5511-8fa6-2677b36f174d" "answer-c810647a-c42a-522a-8d4e-5301429d057c" "answer-fa7daa64-9324-5510-bf53-292b940a1d6f" "answer-229fc38f-7a75-5c2c-bdb9-4a89c232f57e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1fc34fbe-0ac6-5122-9d50-7ed8124d6804" :answer/id #uuid "1fc34fbe-0ac6-5122-9d50-7ed8124d6804" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4e22d3f7-480b-5511-8fa6-2677b36f174d" :answer/id #uuid "4e22d3f7-480b-5511-8fa6-2677b36f174d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c810647a-c42a-522a-8d4e-5301429d057c" :answer/id #uuid "c810647a-c42a-522a-8d4e-5301429d057c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa7daa64-9324-5510-bf53-292b940a1d6f" :answer/id #uuid "fa7daa64-9324-5510-bf53-292b940a1d6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-229fc38f-7a75-5c2c-bdb9-4a89c232f57e" :answer/id #uuid "229fc38f-7a75-5c2c-bdb9-4a89c232f57e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065435 :tutorial/content "Suppose we want to calculate the integral\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2x}\\,\\textrm d x.\n$$\n\nAt first glance, this looks kind of tricky. However, if we use the identity $\\dfrac{1}{\\sin x} = \\csc x,$ we can rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we see that this is just a standard trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2x}\\,\\textrm d x  =  \\int\\csc^2 x\\,\\textrm d x =-\\cot x + C\n$$\n\nWhen confronted with a tricky-looking trigonometric integral, we can often reduce it to a standard integral using a trigonometric identity." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064389 :activity/expected-seconds 1320.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065085 :step/math-academy-id 639749 :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065086 :step/math-academy-id 639750 :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065087 :step/math-academy-id 639753 :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186065088 :step/math-academy-id 639756 :db/ensure [:step/validate]}]
